OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet start
OL,6,Fto the night, with strong and gusty
OL,7,Fwinds. Clear spells developing later,
OL,8,Fwith some showers affecting western
OL,9,Fparts, but most places should stay
OL,10,Fdry. Remaining windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FSunny spells for most, with
OL,13,Fperhaps one or two showers affecting
OL,14,Fthe west of the region. It will remain
OL,15,Fwindy, especially along the coast,
OL,16,Fwhere gales are possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
